WEBVTT

00:04:26.512 --> 00:04:30.308
It turns out that the opening decades
of the 21st century,

00:04:30.308 --> 00:04:32.143
as bad as they were, for many,

00:04:32.184 --> 00:04:34.645
are merely the leading edge
of a hurricane.

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:36.856
Now ...

00:04:37.565 --> 00:04:40.526
despite everything I've just said to you,

00:04:40.526 --> 00:04:41.819
I'm an optimist.

00:04:42.486 --> 00:04:48.868
I believe that humans have the ingenuity
to address all of these challenges

00:04:48.868 --> 00:04:52.455
and reach unprecedented prosperity
and liberty for all.

00:04:53.914 --> 00:04:56.751
That can happen by employing the state

00:04:56.751 --> 00:04:59.086
and leveraging the technology revolution.

00:04:59.086 --> 00:05:00.463
I wrote a book about it.